Sqlite.Auth.User.comment:
 Add and get users from the database.

## Expected database schema

The minimum required table schema for this module to work is below:

    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (
        id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
        created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,
        updated_at INTEGER NOT NULL
    );

`id` is expected to be a unique identifier. Functions in this module generate UUID 
v4 id strings. Both `created_at` and `updated_at` are posix timestamp values.

The `users` table is used as a foreign key reference for _all_ other modules in this 
package. As such, it is required for most, if not all, of the functions in this package
to operate successfully.

